{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>藍田邨有單位發生爆炸。今日（29日）早上約10時29分，藍田邨藍碧樓一單位傳出爆炸巨響，驚動多人報案。消防員接報趕抵，一度派出一隊煙帽隊及一條喉戒備，最後在11時35分停止動員。</p><p>救援人員在場發現一名50歲女傷者，其身體有多達四成面積燒傷，面部及雙手等多處均須貼上敷料，清醒臥擔架床由救護車送往伊利沙伯醫院治理。事件中，約80名居民疏散。警方及消防封鎖其中3層樓調查；現場可見，涉事單位窗戶玻璃盡碎，大廈對開滿佈散落的雜物。</p><figure><img alt=\"女傷者面部及雙手等全身多處，均須貼上敷料，臥擔架床送院。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260529/1136992112865579008957846.jpeg/-YieV4QCkd18DipI98BfUAFw7M3haq--7oBwz-6AcM8\"/><figcaption>女傷者面部及雙手等全身多處，均須貼上敷料，臥擔架床送院。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"女傷者面部及雙手等全身多處，均須貼上敷料，臥擔架床送院。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260529/1136992105525153792841970.jpeg/UdcFw-rqAFpjAk9jYOuFUNR1iKg7vinxopk0vqKZNL4\"/><figcaption>女傷者面部及雙手等全身多處，均須貼上敷料，臥擔架床送院。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"女傷者面部及雙手等全身多處，均須貼上敷料，臥擔架床送院。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260529/1136992108268359680237914.jpeg/vBACyPFCsYRAMQrqEZP8zyh3Ao-w_Rx0D3Wtdw91rXc\"/><figcaption>女傷者面部及雙手等全身多處，均須貼上敷料，臥擔架床送院。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"女傷者面部及雙手等全身多處，均須貼上敷料，臥擔架床送院。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260529/1136992110558580736456238.jpeg/4TR52QbFo75qwgeZXYdYbF789NtNmUl-n0f7pJ9H-6Q\"/><figcaption>女傷者面部及雙手等全身多處，均須貼上敷料，臥擔架床送院。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"發生事故單位的窗盡開。（蔡正邦攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260529/1137015494700699648308672.jpeg/0hYU_bQAaivb3ROFJXxH8qY3vpMndCjhGcKdzRnCnc0\"/><figcaption>發生事故單位的窗盡開。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"外牆簷篷散落玻璃碎。（蔡正邦攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260529/1137015496932200448957124.jpeg/cA5-JFPT2SpQnV_k-UIbIZ7P9mnoCXWDf01-JH9NfiQ\"/><figcaption>外牆簷篷散落玻璃碎。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260529/1137015499310501888682953.jpeg/to7ep8i05fRJ7nmgLajU3nad821X6hl1IksleCJLJXg\"/><figure><img alt=\"發生事故單位的窗門玻璃窗盡碎。（蔡正邦攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260529/1137015501797855232098574.jpeg/TDw6QIhw_oojWMzkvA17cLEaqEathTH4WieowFonqMA\"/><figcaption>發生事故單位的窗門玻璃窗盡碎。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"發生事故單位的窗門玻璃窗盡碎。（蔡正邦攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260529/1137015503974830080815620.jpeg/7P2k9lAy6ffWxNcoGm6Rate3lKwc3rr2FM9NPRTPTT0\"/><figcaption>發生事故單位的窗門玻璃窗盡碎。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"有雜物飛散大廈對開地面。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260529/1137009923960475648782035.jpeg/An67NjQtOan10salxrshd1D4NkDPNn4pXxdJKV8XSSk\"/><figcaption>有雜物飛散大廈對開地面。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員到場調查。（羅敏妍攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260529/1137009921473122304483915.jpeg/pPsNpWKuXwyZDCR7g9nfDL0GI64pEhmZgdCeGoHQnho\"/><figcaption>警員到場調查。（羅敏妍攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場為藍田邨藍碧樓。（羅敏妍攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260529/1137009926238113792572861.jpeg/GGKaLyfUPAloanNetpvuv7un5gUphuoaigpyBYoKcgU\"/><figcaption>現場為藍田邨藍碧樓。（羅敏妍攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"居民疏散落樓。（羅敏妍攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260529/1137014860127670272927138.jpeg/uMniAW_3nK9_3pek7CHWmOtYjK0brrmiBYkBdgWJAXY\"/><figcaption>居民疏散落樓。（羅敏妍攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"居民疏散落樓。（羅敏妍攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260529/1137014863277723648297534.jpeg/zk1JFIrzkpDJXtpfNDPw3ynRdGykCqCHOUZxQzlGcUM\"/><figcaption>居民疏散落樓。（羅敏妍攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"多名居民疏散。（蔡正邦攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260529/1137009930797584384943721.jpeg/QX0nVHx2gTFgW0LmbXXml7HeH2CqKptAKvpLQCr6S0A\"/><figcaption>多名居民疏散。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"有燒焦雜物遺於大廈對開地面。（羅敏妍攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260529/1137009921477316608584971.jpeg/gSSa-jduCzPDr2vItEGg6wbIxMDrxQpRAB760wAe-tM\"/><figcaption>有燒焦雜物遺於大廈對開地面。（羅敏妍攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員到場調查。（羅敏妍攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260529/1137009923889172480372589.jpeg/iMbmpfadDvtNWU_w-aYCvNvo418uZasry5OYqMuTmKg\"/><figcaption>警員到場調查。（羅敏妍攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場為藍田邨藍碧樓；警員封鎖現場調查。（羅敏妍攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260529/1137009921288572928357892.jpeg/P0JsyDXcka5w8DuXdnrWkPBBybNsZazxBJJEMASSRDA\"/><figcaption>現場為藍田邨藍碧樓；警員封鎖現場調查。（羅敏妍攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場為藍田邨藍碧樓；消防趕抵救援。（羅敏妍攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260529/1137009923750760448084765.jpeg/b5FoQWQR23h8xspcwps2j1YLEt4V-OWVTsnmaU7J5mk\"/><figcaption>現場為藍田邨藍碧樓；消防趕抵救援。（羅敏妍攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"大批消防到場救援。（Facebook Annis）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260529/1136988651482255360105832.jpeg/_gGNy4REiNVQnPHUTi92OpI3-f1SFxjdYId-zGCHfsw\"/><figcaption>大批消防到場救援。（Facebook Annis）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"大批消防到場救援，有居民需要疏散。（Threads / peter）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260529/1136992522334113792398751.jpeg/MDF8R2Lzh1LyPH_Hybu888Uy2rLziIgmELfXMBC31zA\"/><figcaption>大批消防到場救援，有居民需要疏散。（Threads / peter）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"大批消防到場救援，有居民需要疏散。（Threads / peter）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260529/1136992524838244352907481.jpeg/mx4sIQ3gqw-wLbSmDPVec7SSC56zRzSnaowVV2qMFVc\"/><figcaption>大批消防到場救援，有居民需要疏散。（Threads / peter）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-29T06:58:59.064225+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":674,"images":22,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}